# Orchestrator run artifacts — never versioned (anti-replay of approval
# tokens + state.json divergence, findings H1/H4). The review reports
# (.runs/*-review.md) stay tracked for the audit.
**/.approvals/
**/.runs/state.json
**/.runs/journal.jsonl

# Raw client inputs feeding a feature (slides, transcripts, quotes…) live in
# work/<feature>/assets/ and are NOT versioned by default: they are often sensitive
# client data, the lab template stays generic/org-neutral, and the spec/design/tasks
# derived from them are what gets committed. A deployment that wants them versioned
# opts in by editing this rule. See docs/how-to/ingest-client-assets.md.
work/**/assets/
